nt_names, nearest_work_difference, falsifier}]. Cover retrieved industry cards; identify the concrete changed mechanism for used cards. This is provenance, not causal proof.\", \"reflection\": \"Review the latest knowledge-usage.json alongside outcomes; distinguish declared use, executed changes, mechanism evidence and unresolved attribution.\"}\nno_test_feedback true\nTRAJECTORIES\nbaseline-din success auc 0.8099233880793816 ll 0.05662295138414975 seconds 329.1126111894846 parameters 32059429\ng0-r0004-zero_feedback_counts success auc 0.8275704845768582 ll 0.054885143214040207 seconds 391.9586809128523 parameters 32944901\ng0-r0005-linear_moment success auc 0.8283262734957326 ll 0.054728202184133226 seconds 406.3111769556999 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0005-quadratic_moment success auc 0.8280653433547251 ll 0.05480999852416494 seconds 404.4931601434946 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0005-copy_moment success auc 0.8278826251940282 ll 0.0548144761863322 seconds 402.8166333734989 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0005-zero_moment success auc 0.8275704845768582 ll 0.054885143214040207 seconds 408.7981459200382 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0006-within_centered success auc 0.8281966383318404 ll 0.05471739383550587 seconds 415.24974578619003 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0006-occupancy_timing success auc 0.8278706980597653 ll 0.054848399621173494 seconds 403.02699284255505 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0006-full_replay success auc 0.8283262734957326 ll 0.054728202184133226 seconds 403.0133200585842 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0006-zero_component success auc 0.8275704845768582 ll 0.054885143214040207 seconds 405.89221324026585 parameters 32948357\ng0-r0007-untied_timing success auc 0.8285167725254684 ll 0.05472060824815212 seconds 420.6954885870218 parameters 32951941\ng0-r0007-duplicate_full success auc 0.8285846691106282 ll 0.05471635301487221 seconds 407.5196486711502 parameters 32951941\ng0-r0007-parent_replay success auc 0.8283262734957326 ll 0.054728202184133226 seconds 409.40310499072075 parameters 3