uct all four models with common host seed and FeatureMap. Check exact inherited parameter/buffer equality against duplicate_full, CPU RNG preservation and equal all-arm initial predictions in eval and cloned-state train mode; newly added route buffers are intentionally different only in rotated.',\n  'Check all32977029 parameters,31793216 embeddings and1183813 dense (at frozen defaults); bank parameter is registered as dense, zero-initialized, on device and in optimizer. Verify all active banks receive finite gradients on a synthetic nondegenerate set; shared rows have equal gradients, zero bank gradients are zero.',\n  'Full CPU/GPU FP32 and frozen BF16 forward/backward: all four keys,shape[B,1],finite probabilities/gradients/loss for empty/all-padding/zero-length,singleton,holey/short/full histories,missing or overlapping relations; actual Torch execution is not available locally.',\n  'Perturb padded item/action IDs, all current action IDs, and unused historical task masks; predictions must be invariant in eval and cloned-state train mode. Preserve fixed forward information boundary and count/temporal-key masking.',\n  'Independent dense-loop oracle for bank einsum and gradient routing; relation and rotated same for tied banks; nonuniform banks demonstrate different sharing; no-match and singleton-bin rank moments yield zero bank contribution. Test all five windows/seven relations including windows with no visible history.',\n  'Compare zero_bank initial and one-step/training replay against archived duplicate_full with explicit precision tolerances and identical data order; clipping reduction order may introduce numerical noise. Do not interpret active comparisons until any unexplained discrepancy is resolved. Source-only equivalence is not execution evidence.',\n  'Measure full-model wall time,train/inference seconds,latency,peak memory,parameter counts and per-bank activation/gradient mass if supported by the authorized host; do not infer equal measured cost from equal nominal MACs. Retain every failed check/attempt and enforce trial cap.',\n  'Score only complete validation; report macro AUC/Logloss and every task delta relative to DIN and incumbent. Use existing history slice bins with counts; label further occupancy slices exploratory. No withheld scores/predictions or assessment archive access.'\n ],\n 'reproduction':{'interface':'Host consumes proposal.json variants[].file and variants[].config; instantiate Model(feature_map,**architecture_config) with the frozen host task/optimizer recipe. No standalone training command exists in this workspace.','local_syntax_command':'python3 -m py_compile candidate.py control_rotated.py control_shared.py control_zero.py','host_commands':'Unavailable in this phase; do not invent a training CLI or execute training.','selection':'taobao-four-task-macro-auc-v1; validation only'},\n 'preflight_records':[]}\nassert all(x in ids for x in study['evidence_refs'])\nPath('/workspace/proposal.json').write_text(json.dumps(proposal,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\nprint('Wrote proposal with',len(variants),'standalone variants,',len(obs),'receipt observations and',len(assessments),'knowledge assessments.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
