ay anchor for duplicate_full; same forward contraction, ineffective added gradients.')]:\n import ast\n tree=ast.parse(Path('/workspace/'+file).read_text());config=next(ast.literal_eval(x.value) for x in tree.body if isinstance(x,ast.Assign) and any(isinstance(y,ast.Name) and y.id=='CONFIG' for y in x.targets))\n variants.append({'name':name,'file':file,'role':role,'config':config,'note':note+' From scratch under the frozen host recipe; full numerical preflight required, no local training or measured new performance.'})\nassessments=[]\nfor id,decision,rationale,diff,names in [\n ('unirank-method-hiformer','used','Pinned fieldwise tokenizer and per-token FFN code supports considering heterogeneous transformations; local evidence, not card ranking, selects relation-specific compression.','Transform the heterogeneous-sharing idea into a seven-bank residual on existing temporal-relation rank summaries. No HiFormer block/task-token implementation adopted; originality remains unverified.',['relation_bank','rotated_bank','shared_bank','zero_bank']),\n ('unirank-method-rankmixer','considered','Chunk tokenization/per-token processing is a nearest reference; inspected pinned constructor and benchmark description.','No chunk/token mixing adopted; keep semantic overlap and summary shapes fixed.',[]),\n ('unirank-method-unimixer','considered','Pinned full-flattening forward inspected; preceding study considered this as a broader replacement. Present contrast first isolates semantic sharing at fixed information.','Do not add flattened event access or new history tokens.',[]),\n ('unirank-method-tokenformer','considered','Card and bounded pinned constructor inspected; event-token full/window attention is a possible future replacement but not evidence of local benefit.','No full/window event attention or sparse kernel copied; preserve existing valid-key masking.',[])]:\n assessments.append({'knowledge_id':id,'decision':decision,'rationale':rationale,'transformed_mechanism':diff if decision=='used' else 'None newly adopted.','variant_names':names,'nearest_work_difference':diff,'falsifier':'A semantic-bank tie/loss against the balanced rotated bank defeats the present transfer hypothesis; it does not reproduce or refute the complete external architecture.' if decision=='used' else 'These arms cannot test the full referenced architecture; effectiveness remains unresolved without a matched local replacement.'})\nobs=[]\nfor t in c['trajectory_index']:\n if t['id'] in study['evidence_refs']:\n  obs.append({'trial_id':t['id'],'status':t['status'],'macro_auc':t.get('auc'),'wall_seconds':t.get('wall_seconds'),'maturity':'local_observation','provenance':'run://r-001 context.trajectory_index; own-arm validation, fixed seed; not independent replication'})\nproposal={'study':study,'parent_trial':parent,'variants':variants,'knowledge_assessments':assessments,\n 'observations_and_limits':{\n  'new_measurements':False,'phase':'propose','available_environment':'Read-only task/runtime/registry/evidence and baseline/ancestor sources; editable model modules and proposal. No torch,numpy,jsonschema,raw parquet,GPU or local evaluation interface. Host supplies training and validation. Dataset verification and historical training are inherited receipts, not independently reproduced here.',\n  'previous_runtime_error':c['previous_runtime_error'],\n  'history_review':'All31 committed trajectories are successful execution receipts; several scientifically negative/null branches remain recorded. Recency beat pooled slots, but field grouping had interactions with temporal construction; seven replicas outperformed atomic/coordinate partitions. Relation content dominated relation-count-only and replica controls. Explicit joint/independent/marginal feedback count channels did not beat zero feedback counts. Linear rank moment outperformed quadratic/copy/zero; within-only and occupancy-only did not beat full. Untied occupancy map failed to beat duplicate_full, leaving an optimization/capacity explanation. No execution failure is invented and deterministic replays are not seed replication.',\n  'latest_knowledge_usage_review':'Previous study considered HeMix,UniMixer,UltraHSTU,Zenith and executed no newly adopted external mechanism. Its untied timing direction did not beat the active duplicate control. Thus those cards provide provenance/context, not causal support; do not silently carry them forward as used architecture. Current HiFormer-inspired parameter sharing is separately declared and controlled.',\n  'source_boundary':'HiFormer original detailed text unavailable in authorized registry; benchmark implementation verified only. All priority/novelty and source-task transfer claims remain unverified.',\n  'receipt_observations':obs,\n  'slice_observations':[{'trial_id':id,'history_slices':{n:{'samples':s['samples'],'macro_auc':s.get('macro_auc'),'macro_logloss':s.get('macro_logloss'),'task_counts':{k:{'positives':v['positives'],'negatives':v['negatives']} for k,v in s['per_task'].items()}} for n,s in next(x for x in c['history'] if x['id']==id)['validation']['slices'].items()}} for id in ['baseline-din','g0-r0007-duplicate_full','g0-r0007-parent_replay']],\n  'slice_limit':'History-bin evidence is descriptive, not a causal reason to redesign any particular task. Empty histories have only13 buy positives. No relation sparsity/per-bank gradient diagnostics exist locally; do not claim their observed distribution.',\n  'memory_handling':'No writable agent-memory endpoint/file is declared. Record evidence-linked observations and provisional revision appendices in this authorized proposal for host ingestion; do not edit evidence.jsonl or human-owned knowledge. Personal knowledge is disabled.'},\n 'host_acceptance_checks':[\n  'Verify pinned source/config hashes and all architecture-only config; current task/protocol/data identity and required readiness receipts must match. This workspace cannot independently inspect raw parquets.',\n  'Cons